    {
      "id": "claim_1ed78618c0284720b65e1c5423e3914b",
      "statement": "A `WebDecoy` instance without an API key runs in local-only mode: local rules still evaluate, while construction of the authenticated `WebDecoyClient` is conditional on an API key; authenticated clients also enable automatic IP enrichment for filter rules and violation reporting when rules exist.",
