    {
      "id": "claim_bf3873b6d691448c9fa2ada20f8805f3",
      "statement": "`protect()` evaluates local rules before cache lookup and remote detection; a local refusal returns a local denial without a detection call, no API client returns a local allow, and remote detection is called only after local analysis says verification or TLS fingerprinting requires it.",
