      "id": "claim_f380ec388b5545d481b594a856a29d72",
      "statement": "A failed protection pipeline, including a failed remote detection call or malformed request metadata, is logged and returned as an `ERROR` decision; `ERROR` is allowed fail-open but remains distinct from an affirmative `ALLOW`.",
