      "id": "claim_4c428129d1f64073b83a19e103473453",
      "statement": "The SDK maps a remote response using the configured or per-call threat threshold: service `allow` or below-threshold confidence yields `ALLOW`, a qualifying `challenge` yields `CHALLENGE`, and another qualifying non-allow response yields `DENY`.",
